<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALY BEAT NORTHERN IRELAND 2-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALY BEAT NORTHERN IRELAND 2-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>PALERMO 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy beat Northern Ireland 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in a friendly on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Zola 10, Del Piero 90</p>
<p>Attendance: 38,000</p>
